  "reflectionText": "The Lord says in the psalm: because he has set his love on me, therefore I will deliver him. I will be with him in trouble. I will satisfy him with long life and show him my salvation. How does it land to be told that the One you set your love on has set his love on you in return, and will be with you in the trouble you cannot yet name?"
